# The target must still be a legal target as the ability resolves (CR 608.2b): Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt, Bot1 flashes the Impostors in, and in response to the
# enters trigger Bot2 counters its own Bolt with Counterspell. The ability's one target is gone, so it does nothing: no counter and no manifest dread for
